{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0384_1000_045kar", "source_sha256": "1137423643e6912a74faca12ff273b90145ea3a2943d402914a5438ccf6e8797", "ja": "ええっと……め、恵美ちゃんらしくするには……。\n堂々として……口調はハッキリ……！", "zh": "呃……要、要表现得像惠美……就得……\n大大方方的……说话要干脆……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0384_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "7a95ec0882a39542dd1860860647b4bebcf1110eb5497756a2a644cf283d18b6", "ja": "「アタシに任せてよ♪　{$P$}！」\n……こ、こんな感じかな……？", "zh": "“包在我身上吧♪　{$P$}！”\n……是、是这种感觉吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0384_1002_p", "source_sha256": "fbaccf98286c8477e04bdf5f5a1849471dee4df92fdae32cf308eba23b433407", "ja": "えっと……可憐、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "那个……可怜，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0384_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "bd05046a4cde5eb5ba479c7116ffab5210c84f248c844c24d3ea530c9bb60c6f", "ja": "ひゃぁ！　{$P$}さん……！\nい、いつから、そこに……？", "zh": "呀！{$P$}先生……！\n你、你什么时候来的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0384_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1e230134046d5ab5d77ee11bac09c7e227170ca3889ea0eedbbb2ccc1d03c39a", "ja": "今来たところだよ。\n……さっきのは、恵美のマネか？", "zh": "我刚到。\n……刚才那是在模仿惠美吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0384_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "f69998aeddf7d4f180c7df6bfc8104eae471bf3d02a322003286be901056ce1a", "ja": "は、はい……。あ、あの、恵美ちゃんが\n考えてくれたこの衣装が、と、とっても素敵で……。", "zh": "是、是的……那、那个，惠美设计的这套服装，真、真的非常漂亮……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0384_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "f6535bfa52f6269092fa218af4f7051c7009588c8ce57d8bd72316e5aa87de31", "ja": "恵美ちゃんらしいデザインだから……せ、性格も\n近づけてみたら……もっと、似合うのかなって……。", "zh": "因为这是很有惠美风格的设计……所、所以我想，要是性格也试着变得更像她……是不是就会更适合这套衣服了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0384_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7e9f3e7c639d26f7cecfd200e190fb95d00f421e995fa13ca087b9cc93606616", "ja": "なるほどな……。でもモノマネなんてしなくても、\n可憐によく似合ってるよ。", "zh": "原来如此……不过，就算不模仿，也很适合可怜哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0384_1008_p", "source_sha256": "eafc5b6a81a0e151a475b485b955750c279bf2cd81ad75b075711e422e6d191c", "ja": "きっと恵美は、いつも一緒にいる可憐に似合うように\nその衣装を考えたんじゃないかな。", "zh": "我想，惠美一定是为了和总是在一起的可怜相称，才设计了那套服装吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0384_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "5d636019776febe6b7489fb6e10721fb7c1fe3b992717bc75b361641b7f4acf8", "ja": "恵美ちゃんといる、私……？", "zh": "和惠美酱在一起的我……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0384_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c6ab7fa97241e013a7bd4649c05ef0408017bf35efc4347e15f7801c7b3a582e", "ja": "ああ。\nだから、普段どおりでいいと思うけど……。", "zh": "啊。\n所以，我觉得像平时那样就好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0384_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "c18d7e97f174e0e00d51e62512aefa7919e03b758a9e9995235294fb39f9b3c9", "ja": "で、でも……。恵美ちゃん、\n何日も何日も、真剣に考えてくれたんです……。", "zh": "可、可是……惠美她，为了这件事认真考虑了好多天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0384_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "be29cb33051325ecddfea53e01de7cc28c1a6d844f0e2dc69dff02d2c1b7e101", "ja": "だ、だからこそ……この服に、一番ふさわしい\n自分になりたいって思って……それで……。", "zh": "所、所以才更想成为最适合这件衣服的自己……所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0384_1013_p", "source_sha256": "9fb71e0f6734a5c6975e6d8377816499aa736a6cba67c92d94d92c09031ee7a3", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。尚更、可憐が可憐らしく、\n堂々とそれを着るのが大事なんじゃないか？", "zh": "啊，说得对。正因如此，让可怜以可怜的方式，堂堂正正地穿上它，不是更重要吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0384_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "4197f6aae92c49a1d24217a074c82e559460e80fbcd3c72d74a9b3da11dc6e56", "ja": "……私が、私らしく……堂々と……？", "zh": "……我，要做自己……堂堂正正地……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
