{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0384_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "0fb2c38894f7c98faef0273743abab8644ae39ae78af64b4dbb69349d67dddef", "ja": "そ、そっか……。そう、ですよね……。\n私のための、服、ですもんね…………。", "zh": "哦、哦这样啊……是、是呢……毕竟是为我准备的衣服嘛…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
