{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0384_1019_045kar", "source_sha256": "51196bacbe4ed80743dda8b0d33cd92eacd76b85b51207715c76b9473adea2a4", "ja": "あっ……ち、違うんです……！　め、恵美ちゃんの\nマネ、とか……そういうのじゃなくて……。", "zh": "啊……不、不是这样的……！我、我不是想学惠美……之类的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
